# KOC Live Charts Verification Plan

- [ ] Navigate to http://localhost:3000/koc-live
- [ ] Verify 4 chart panels are visible:
    - Trend (Revenue)
    - Peak Hours (Session distribution)
    - Ranking (Top 10 KOC)
    - Scatter (Performance)
- [ ] Check for console errors or build errors
- [ ] Take screenshot of the charts section
- [ ] Verify empty state if no data is present
